OL,3,APassengers stranded as strike disrupts
OL,4,Aflights at Kenya's main airport
OL,5,
OL,6,FHundreds of passengers were stranded at
OL,7,FKenya's main airport in the capital,
OL,8,FNairobi, as flight disruptions
OL,9,Fcontinued for the second day amid a
OL,10,Fworkers' strike.
OL,12,FJomo Kenyatta International Airport
OL,13,F(JKIA) is a key regional transport hub.
OL,15,FOn Sunday, the airports authority and
OL,16,Fthe national carrier, Kenya Airways,
OL,17,Fwarned departing flights may be
OL,18,Fdelayed.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
